+    <a class="skip-link" href="#content">Skip to lesson</a>
+    <header class="site-header">
+      <div class="site-header__inner">
+        <p class="eyebrow">Lesson 4 of 4</p>
+        <h1>Separate presence from state</h1>
+        <p class="lede">
+          Ask whether a runtime exists and what its agent is doing as two
+          different questions.
+        </p>
+      </div>
+    </header>
