+# What is now understood
+
+In one to three sentences, state the non-obvious concept you can now apply and
+why it changes a future `tss` decision.
+
+## Evidence
+
+Describe the decision, explanation, or exercise that demonstrated the
+understanding. Merely reading or completing a lesson is not evidence.
+
+## Implication
+
+State what can be taught next, skipped, or revisited because of this evidence.
